# Anthropic Shared Dependencies for Loon
# Revision: 2026-11-02-anthropic-shared-1
# Supplement to AI-Suite.list; bind both subscriptions to the same policy in Loon.
# Official access requirements do NOT mean identical egress is mandatory.
# Exact shared hosts also affect unrelated apps; no credentials or user IPs included.
# Sources:
# https://code.claude.com/docs/en/network-config
# https://code.claude.com/docs/en/desktop

# > Artifacts JavaScript libraries
DOMAIN,cdnjs.cloudflare.com
DOMAIN,cdn.jsdelivr.net
DOMAIN,cdn.tailwindcss.com
DOMAIN,code.jquery.com
DOMAIN,unpkg.com

# > Optional Claude Code operational telemetry
DOMAIN,http-intake.logs.us5.datadoghq.com
DOMAIN,browser-intake-us5-datadoghq.com

# > Claude Code plugins, installers, release notes and update checks
# Shared hosts can carry large downloads and unrelated development traffic.
DOMAIN,storage.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,registry.npmjs.org
DOMAIN,github.com
DOMAIN,raw.githubusercontent.com
DOMAIN,formulae.brew.sh
